data: {"id": "772b8aff28de41e8-thinking-parallel_evidence-3026", "run_id": "772b8aff28de41e8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 修复后的工具结果汇总\n\n### ✅ 成功结果\n\n**1. Topology（拓扑）** - `query_pod_topology` 成功\n- Pod UID: `765655de-3481-4d60-b455-1fa4b463a0c2`\n- IP: `172.16.166.165`\n- 容器: `prometheus` (属于该 Pod)\n- 控制器: StatefulSet `prometheus-observability-prometheus` (UID `3cffa0dd-cc22-417a-b106-7060f4097486`)\n- 调度节点: `node1`\n- 限制: 无法获取 Prometheus CRD (`prometheuses.monitoring.coreos.com`) 的所有者信息，权限被拒绝\n\n**2. Metrics（PromQL）** - `execute_pod_promql` 成功\n- 查询 `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason{reason=\"OOMKilled\"}` 返回了", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789038229102, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

